@startuml C4-Container

title BFS and DFS Graph Search - Container Level

actor User

rectangle "BFS and DFS Graph Search System" as System {

    rectangle "Graph Input Module" as Input

    rectangle "BFS Search Module" as BFS

    rectangle "DFS Search Module" as DFS

    rectangle "Performance Measurement Module" as Performance

    rectangle "Profiling Module" as Profiling

    rectangle "Output Module" as Output
}

User --> Input : Provides graph and search input

Input --> BFS : Provides graph
Input --> DFS : Provides graph

BFS --> Performance : Provides BFS execution data
DFS --> Performance : Provides DFS execution data

Performance --> Profiling : Sends performance data

BFS --> Output : Returns BFS result
DFS --> Output : Returns DFS result
Performance --> Output : Returns comparison

Output --> User : Displays results

@enduml